msgctxt "Leve:1211:0:1"
msgid "Some of the smallfolk have witnessed the use of Coerthan crabs in keeping the priests alert in their prayers, misunderstanding it as some new ritual for connecting with the Fury. There have been requests for the same treatment during church services, and I would have refused them had they not offered to pay coin. A barrel full of the little pinchers, if you will.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Некоторые простолюдины видели, как керсскими крабихами не дают священникам уснуть во время молитвы, и приняли это за новый обряд связи с Яростью. Теперь просят устроить то же самое во время службы. Я бы отказал, но они платят. Так что извольте доставить бочку этих щипучих созданий.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：放流用のマクロブラキウム
#. de: Großfreibrief: Läuseplage
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: des crevettes à l'égout
#. column 1: 'Twould seem the city's waterways have become contaminated with whisperworms─tiny creatures that crawl into a man's ears during bathing and cloud his mind, convincing him he is hearing voices. If the worms grow in number, half of Ishgard could be rendered mad. The only way to get rid of such annoyances is to drop blueclaw shrimp into the sewers and pray to Halone that they eat their fill and cleanse the water of pests.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1212:0:0"
msgid "A Whole Lot of Nope (L)"
msgstr "Ну и гадость! (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>皇都内の水路に、水棲昆虫がはびこり問題となっている。そこで捕食者として、マクロブラキウムを放流するという計画が持ち上がった。効果があるかどうかは未知数だが、ぜひとも活きの良い個体を捕まえてきてもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In der Kanalisation Ishgards haben sich Wasserläuse zu einer echten Plage entwickelt. Um sie auszurotten will man Blauklauen-Garnelen in die Kanäle entlassen, denn Wasserläuse gehören zu ihrer Beute. Wie gut dieser Plan funktionieren wird, ist noch nicht abzusehen, aber erst einmal wird ein Fischer gesucht, der Blauklauen-Garnelen heranschaffen kann.
#. fr: Les canalisations du Saint-Siège étant infestées de parasites, nous avons décidé d'y introduire un prédateur naturel, la crevette géante bleue, et il nous faut donc quelques spécimens prélevés dans leur habitat d'origine.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: A Whole Lot of Nope (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1212:0:1"
msgid "'Twould seem the city's waterways have become contaminated with whisperworms─tiny creatures that crawl into a man's ears during bathing and cloud his mind, convincing him he is hearing voices. If the worms grow in number, half of Ishgard could be rendered mad. The only way to get rid of such annoyances is to drop blueclaw shrimp into the sewers and pray to Halone that they eat their fill and cleanse the water of pests.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Похоже, водные каналы города заражены шептунами — крошечными тварями, которые заползают человеку в уши во время купания и мутят разум, заставляя слышать голоса. Если их станет больше, пол-Ишгарда сойдёт с ума. Избавиться от этой напасти можно, если пустить в сточные каналы синеклешневых креветок и молиться Халонэ, чтобы те наелись досыта и очистили воду от вредителей.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模大量採集：晩餐会用のレイクアーチン
#. de: Großfreibrief: Fischen für anspruchsvolle Gäste
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: des oursins pour les pontes
#. column 1: A spineball tournament is to take place at Camp Dragonhead, wherein two teams of residents will kick around a spiny lake urchin and see if they can get it into a barrel using only their boots. I can only imagine the look on the head chirurgeon's face the next day, but as they say: “The most primitive form of entertainment is watching others in pain.”<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1213:0:0"
msgid "Lurchin' from Urchins (L)"
msgstr "Катать ежей (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>教皇庁のお歴々を招いた晩餐会が開催される運びとなった。そこで供するレイクアーチンの調達を任せたい。舌の肥えた高位聖職者も多いため、できるだけ味の良さそうな大振りのヤツを、大量に納品してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die hochrangigen Priester halten ein Bankett ab, zu dem unter anderem Seeigel gereicht werden soll. Von ihren eigenen Köchen sind die hohen Damen und Herren einiges gewohnt. Die Seeigel sollten daher von allerhöchster Qualität sein, um die Gäste zufrieden zu stimmen.
#. fr: Un important dîner, auquel les plus hauts dignitaires du Saint-Siège seront invités, doit être organisé pro<shy>chai<shy>ne<shy>ment. Nous comptons en faire un véritable festin en servant un grand nombre d'oursins des lacs.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Lurchin' from Urchins (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1213:0:1"
msgid "A spineball tournament is to take place at Camp Dragonhead, wherein two teams of residents will kick around a spiny lake urchin and see if they can get it into a barrel using only their boots. I can only imagine the look on the head chirurgeon's face the next day, but as they say: “The most primitive form of entertainment is watching others in pain.”<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "В Лагере «Драконья голова» устроят турнир по колючему мячу. Две команды местных жителей будут гонять колючего озёрного ежа и постараются загнать его в бочку одними сапогами. Представляю, какое лицо будет у главного хирурга на следующий день. Как говорится: «Самое примитивное развлечение — смотреть, как другим больно».<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：病人食用のスリーリップス
#. de: Krankenhauskost
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: trois lèvres pour les blessés
#. column 1: Injured knights cannot recover with meager rations, even if there is a good chance for survival. Hence I have special permission from the Holy See to procure rations for them that will allow them to return to the battlefield as soon as possible. The three-lip carp is a fine source of nourishment and I would have anglers bring naught but the plumpest for their supper.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1214:0:0"
msgid "Loose Lips Heal (Broken) Hips"
msgstr "Пустая болтовня лечит сломанные кости"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>クルザス西部高地で起こった戦闘で、多数の負傷者が出た。幸い、一命を取り留めた者が多いが、彼らが復帰を果たすには、栄養のある食べ物が必要だ。病人食に用いるスリーリップスを納品してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Schlacht im westlichen Hochland von Coerthas hat viele Opfer gefordert. Diejenigen, die mit dem Leben davongekommen sind, werden derzeit im Hospital der Tempelritter behandelt. Für eine schnelle Genesung ist eine nährstoffreiche Kost unabdingbar. Dreilippen-Karpfen enthalten viel Eiweiß und Vitamine, sie eignen sich daher hervorragend als Kost für die Patienten. Es wird nach einem Fischer gesucht, der das Hospital mit Dreilippen-Karpfen beliefern kann.
#. fr: Une bataille qui a eu lieu dans les Hautes terres du Coerthas occidental nous a laissés avec un grand nombre de blessés. Pour leur permettre de se rétablir au plus vite, nous désirons leur faire manger des carpes à trois lèvres.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Loose Lips Heal (Broken) Hips
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1214:0:1"
msgid "Injured knights cannot recover with meager rations, even if there is a good chance for survival. Hence I have special permission from the Holy See to procure rations for them that will allow them to return to the battlefield as soon as possible. The three-lip carp is a fine source of nourishment and I would have anglers bring naught but the plumpest for their supper.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Раненые рыцари не поправятся на скудном пайке, даже если их жизни уже ничего не угрожает. Святейший престол позволил мне обеспечить их едой, которая поможет скорее вернуться на поле боя. Карп с тремя губами — сытная рыба. Попросите рыболовов доставить самых упитанных, чтобы накормить больных.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：労働者に送る支援物資
#. de: Ein fischiger Dank
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: du poisson au Faucon
#. column 1: As House Dzemael toils to restore Falcon's Nest to its former glory, the carpenters employed seek to restore the villagers' own charred furnishings to their former glory. The house artisans are known for their obsession with detail, and consultations with surviving visitors tell of using grass carp oil as a veneer to glue pieces of wood together in their armoires. Mayhap you can gather some to aid the restoration efforts?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1215:0:0"
msgid "Fish Oils and Forgotten Spoils"
msgstr "Рыбий жир и забытая мебель"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>ファルコンネストの拡張工事には、ゼーメル家の大工を中心に、多くの労働力が投じられている。そんな彼らに支援物資を送る計画なのだが、ぜひとも食料も加えておきたい。大衆好みの素朴な味わいの魚を頼む。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Dank der Unterstützung der Zimmerer aus dem Hause Dzemael geht der Ausbau von Falkenhorst Stück für Stück voran. Mit der nächsten Materiallieferung sollen allen derzeit am Bau beschäftigten Helfern als kleine Aufmerksamkeit ein paar besondere Nahrungsmittel mitgeschickt werden. Die Tempelritter suchen nun nach einem Fischer, der ein paar köstliche Fische zur Lieferung beisteuert.
#. fr: Les travaux d'agrandissement du Nid du faucon requièrent une importante main-d'œuvre, dont notamment les charpentiers de la maison Dzemael, et afin de les soutenir autant que possible, nous désirons leur fournir quelques poissons pour les repas.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Fish Oils and Forgotten Spoils
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1215:0:1"
msgid "As House Dzemael toils to restore Falcon's Nest to its former glory, the carpenters employed seek to restore the villagers' own charred furnishings to their former glory. The house artisans are known for their obsession with detail, and consultations with surviving visitors tell of using grass carp oil as a veneer to glue pieces of wood together in their armoires. Mayhap you can gather some to aid the restoration efforts?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Дом Земель помогает восстановить Соколиное гнездо, а нанятые плотники возвращают сгоревшую мебель жителей деревни в прежний вид. Ремесленники дома славятся вниманием к деталям. По словам уцелевших гостей, для склеивания деревянных деталей шкафов они использовали лак из белого амура. Может, вы добудете его, чтобы помочь с восстановлением?<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大量採集：騎兵団の食料候補
#. de: Angeln über den Wolken
#. fr: Grosse récolte<nbsp>: poisson-nuage au menu
#. column 1: If crops could be grown in the soil near Camp Cloudtop, what need would there be to send food provisions? In speaking with a knowledgeable botanist for advice on the matter, I was told that the flesh of the cloudfish could serve as fertilizer to grow a wide variety of vegetables. This claim amuses, as well as intrigues me, and I would ask a formidable angler to provide samples to test the botanist's theory.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1216:0:0"
msgid "Bounty of Sky, Bounty of Earth"
msgstr "Дары неба и земли"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>キャンプ・クラウドトップの食糧事情を改善するため、現地で調達可能な魚の利用法を模索している。教皇庁専属調理師の協力を仰ぎ、調理法を検討することになったので、材料候補のクラウドフィッシュを集めてくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Um die Versorgungslage in Camp Wolkenwipfel zu verbessern, möchte die Kongregation einen Abenteurer ausschicken, der die lokalen Fischgründe nach zum Verzehr geeigneten Fischen absucht. Ein vom Papst höchst<shy>persön<shy>lich ernannter Gourmet wird das Vorhaben mit seinen Rezepten unterstützen. Es scheint, als wäre er vor allem auf Wolkenfische angewiesen.
#. fr: Nous désirons améliorer les conditions de vie des soldats en poste au camp de Cime-des-nuages, en vérifiant notamment si les poissons qui vivent dans les environs peuvent servir pour leurs rations. Ainsi, nous avons besoin de quelques spécimens de poissons-nuages.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Bounty of Sky, Bounty of Earth
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1216:0:1"
msgid "If crops could be grown in the soil near Camp Cloudtop, what need would there be to send food provisions? In speaking with a knowledgeable botanist for advice on the matter, I was told that the flesh of the cloudfish could serve as fertilizer to grow a wide variety of vegetables. This claim amuses, as well as intrigues me, and I would ask a formidable angler to provide samples to test the botanist's theory.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Если возле Лагеря Облачная вершина можно выращивать овощи, зачем туда отправлять продовольствие? Я спросил совета у сведущего ботаника, и он сказал, что мясо облачной рыбы годится на удобрение для самых разных овощей. Звучит занятно, да и любопытно. Прошу умелого рыболова принести образцы, чтобы проверить его теорию.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：病人食用のスリーリップス
#. de: Großfreibrief: Krankenhauskost
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: trois lèvres pour les blessés
#. column 1: I believe not in the nonsense of the ill fasting for the sake of Halone's mercy. While those knights who feel humiliated of their injuries may find spiritual comfort in it, naught but a steady diet will see them back to their duty. I ask you to gather me three-lip carp so that they may eat well, restore their strength, and return to their duties hale and healthy.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1217:0:0"
msgid "Prayer and Prejudice (L)"
msgstr "Молитва и предрассудки (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>クルザス西部高地で起こった戦闘で、多数の負傷者が出た。幸い、一命を取り留めた者が多いが、彼らが復帰を果たすには、栄養のある食べ物が必要だ。病人食に用いるスリーリップスを納品してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Schlacht im westlichen Hochland von Coerthas hat viele Opfer gefordert. Diejenigen, die mit dem Leben davongekommen sind, werden derzeit im Hospital der Tempelritter behandelt. Für eine schnelle Genesung ist eine nährstoffreiche Kost unabdingbar. Dreilippen-Karpfen enthalten viel Eiweiß und Vitamine, sie eignen sich daher hervorragend als Kost für die Patienten. Es wird nach einem Fischer gesucht, der das Hospital mit Dreilippen-Karpfen beliefern kann.
#. fr: Une bataille qui a eu lieu dans les Hautes terres du Coerthas occidental nous a laissés avec un grand nombre de blessés. Pour leur permettre de se rétablir au plus vite, nous désirons leur faire manger des carpes à trois lèvres.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Prayer and Prejudice (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
