msgctxt "Leve:1217:0:1"
msgid "I believe not in the nonsense of the ill fasting for the sake of Halone's mercy. While those knights who feel humiliated of their injuries may find spiritual comfort in it, naught but a steady diet will see them back to their duty. I ask you to gather me three-lip carp so that they may eat well, restore their strength, and return to their duties hale and healthy.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Не верю я в эту чепуху, будто больным следует голодать, уповая на милость Халонэ. Рыцари, которым стыдно за свои раны, могут найти в посте духовное утешение, но вернуться к службе им поможет только регулярное питание. Добудьте карпов с тремя губами, чтобы больные ели досыта, набрались сил и поскорее вернулись к своим обязанностям здоровыми и крепкими.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：労働者に送る支援物資
#. de: Großfreibrief: Ein fischiger Dank
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: du poisson au Faucon
#. column 1: House Dzemael's carpenters, in consultation with the residents of Falcon's Nest, have been working to refurnish the hamlet, its buildings gutted by the fires of the Calamity. The designs most requested seem to be pre-Calamity, when many pieces of furniture were covered in a special veneer created from grass carp, of all things.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1218:0:0"
msgid "Valuing the Vintage (L)"
msgstr "Ценность старины (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>ファルコンネストの拡張工事には、ゼーメル家の大工を中心に、多くの労働力が投じられている。そんな彼らに支援物資を送る計画なのだが、ぜひとも食料も加えておきたい。大衆好みの素朴な味わいの魚を頼む。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Dank der Unterstützung der Zimmerer aus dem Hause Dzemael geht der Ausbau von Falkenhorst Stück für Stück voran. Mit der nächsten Materiallieferung sollen allen derzeit am Bau beschäftigten Helfern als kleine Aufmerksamkeit ein paar besondere Nahrungsmittel mitgeschickt werden. Die Tempelritter suchen nun nach einem Fischer, der ein paar köstliche Fische zur Lieferung beisteuert.
#. fr: Les travaux d'agrandissement du Nid du faucon requièrent une importante main-d'œuvre, dont notamment les charpentiers de la maison Dzemael, et afin de les soutenir autant que possible, nous désirons leur fournir quelques poissons pour les repas.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Valuing the Vintage (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1218:0:1"
msgid "House Dzemael's carpenters, in consultation with the residents of Falcon's Nest, have been working to refurnish the hamlet, its buildings gutted by the fires of the Calamity. The designs most requested seem to be pre-Calamity, when many pieces of furniture were covered in a special veneer created from grass carp, of all things.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Плотники дома Дземаэль вместе с жителями Соколиного гнезда восстанавливают дома, сожжённые Бедствием, и обставляют их заново. Чаще всего просят мебель в духе довоенных времён. Тогда многие предметы покрывали особым шпоном, который делали — кто бы мог подумать! — из белого амура.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模大量採集：騎兵団の食料候補
#. de: Großfreibrief: Angeln über den Wolken
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: poisson-nuage au menu
#. column 1: Appalled by the lack of gourmet meals for a visiting priest, the Holy See is sending a culinarian of remarkable prestige to Camp Cloudtop to determine what quality cuisine can be prepared with local ingredients. Although rumor has it the woman is so talented that she can turn dung into delicacy, I propose we start with more edible prospects─fetch me a bevy of cloudfish to determine whether the wavekin can be transformed into something palatable.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1219:0:0"
msgid "Eating Like the Natives (L)"
msgstr "Ешь, как местные (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>キャンプ・クラウドトップの食糧事情を改善するため、現地で調達可能な魚の利用法を模索している。教皇庁専属調理師の協力を仰ぎ、調理法を検討することになったので、材料候補のクラウドフィッシュを集めてくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Um die Versorgungslage in Camp Wolkenwipfel zu verbessern, möchte die Kongregation einen Abenteurer ausschicken, der die lokalen Fischgründe nach zum Verzehr geeigneten Fischen absucht. Ein vom Papst höchst<shy>persön<shy>lich ernannter Gourmet wird das Vorhaben mit seinen Rezepten unterstützen. Es scheint, als wäre er vor allem auf Wolkenfische angewiesen.
#. fr: Nous désirons améliorer les conditions de vie des soldats en poste au camp de Cime-des-nuages, en vérifiant notamment si les poissons qui vivent dans les environs peuvent servir pour leurs rations. Ainsi, nous avons besoin de quelques spécimens de poissons-nuages.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Eating Like the Natives (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1219:0:1"
msgid "Appalled by the lack of gourmet meals for a visiting priest, the Holy See is sending a culinarian of remarkable prestige to Camp Cloudtop to determine what quality cuisine can be prepared with local ingredients. Although rumor has it the woman is so talented that she can turn dung into delicacy, I propose we start with more edible prospects─fetch me a bevy of cloudfish to determine whether the wavekin can be transformed into something palatable.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Святой престол возмущён тем, что гостю-священнику не подали изысканных блюд, и отправляет в Лагерь Облачная вершина прославленную кулинарку, чтобы выяснить, что можно приготовить из местных продуктов. Говорят, она так искусна, что даже навоз превратит в деликатес, но для начала предлагаю взять что-нибудь поаппетитнее. Принесите мне побольше облачных рыб — проверим, получится ли из них что-то съедобное.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：マフワイの薬効調査
#. de: Fisch in Medizin?
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: un remède de mahu waï
#. column 1: My counterpart in House Haillenarte has sent me a curious report, noting that the barbarian Vanu Vanu prize the tendrils of the mahu wai in repairing damaged nerves and paralyzed limbs. I know not of this fish or where it can be found, but it may be a rumor worth testing if you are successful in catching a handful of the creatures.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1220:0:0"
msgid "Analysis of Paralysis"
msgstr "Анализ паралича"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>アバラシア雲海の薔薇騎兵団から、興味深い情報が寄せられた。当地に棲まうバヌバヌ族が、マフワイという雲海生物を、傷薬の材料として用いているというのだ。その効能を確認したいので、サンプルを採取してきてくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Ritter der Rosenkavalleristen wollen im Abalathischen Wolkenmeer beobachtet haben, wie die Vanu Vanu so genannte Mahu Wai in einer Medizin zur Wundbehandlung verwenden. Um dieser Sache genauer auf den Grund zu gehen, sucht das Hospital der Tempelritter nun einen Fischer, der ein paar Mahu Wai zur Unter<shy>such<shy>ung fangen kann.
#. fr: Les chevaliers de la Rose nous ont informés que les Vanu Vanu utilisent un mollusque appelé mahu waï comme ingrédient pour leurs remèdes. Nous aimerions en obtenir quelques spécimens pour en vérifier les propriétés.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Analysis of Paralysis
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1220:0:1"
msgid "My counterpart in House Haillenarte has sent me a curious report, noting that the barbarian Vanu Vanu prize the tendrils of the mahu wai in repairing damaged nerves and paralyzed limbs. I know not of this fish or where it can be found, but it may be a rumor worth testing if you are successful in catching a handful of the creatures.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Мой коллега из дома Эйленарт прислал любопытный доклад. Оказывается, дикари вану-вану ценят щупальца маху-вая за их способность восстанавливать повреждённые нервы и парализованные конечности. Я не знаю ни этой рыбы, ни где её искать, но слух стоит проверить. Поймайте несколько штук, если получится.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：研究用のフライングエッグ
#. de: Über drei Ecken
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: des œufs volants pour bienfaiteur
#. column 1: A lord from House Fortemps who guides wealth to our strongboxes is also a self-proclaimed naturalist who spends copious amounts of free time flipping through the drawings of dusty tomes, looking for exotic fish of Eorzea to add to his luxurious aqua garden. Whether his collection leads to viable research I care not, I simply seek an angler to stock him with whatever bizarre fauna he desires so as to keep his mood charitable.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1221:0:0"
msgid "The Aquariums of Ishgard"
msgstr "Ишгардские аквариумы"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>神殿騎士団を始め、さまざまな団体に献金を行い、活動を支援している貴族がいる。その人物が、パトロンとして支える博物学者のために、雲海生物の生態サンプルを欲しているとのことだ。恩に報いるために協力してくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In Ishgard gibt es einen wohlhabenden Adligen, der mit großzügigen Spenden Orden wie dem der Tempelritter unter die Arme greift. Auf seine Bitte hin suchen die Tempelritter derzeit einen Fischer, der Flieger-Eier aus dem Abalathischen Wolkenmeer heranschaffen kann. Der Adlige will damit einen Naturkundler unterstützen, der die Eier zur Forschung braucht.
#. fr: Un généreux noble ishgardais offre ré<shy>gu<shy>liè<shy>re<shy>ment des gils aux templiers et à d'autres corps de chevaliers pour leurs activités. Pour le remercier de ce geste, nous aimerions fournir des spécimens de créatures atypiques à ce gentilhomme que nous savons être un naturaliste en herbe.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: The Aquariums of Ishgard
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1221:0:1"
msgid "A lord from House Fortemps who guides wealth to our strongboxes is also a self-proclaimed naturalist who spends copious amounts of free time flipping through the drawings of dusty tomes, looking for exotic fish of Eorzea to add to his luxurious aqua garden. Whether his collection leads to viable research I care not, I simply seek an angler to stock him with whatever bizarre fauna he desires so as to keep his mood charitable.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Один лорд из дома Форельтан, пополняющий наши казны, объявил себя естествоиспытателем. Всё свободное время он листает старинные книги с иллюстрациями в поисках диковинных рыб Эорзеи для своего роскошного водного сада. Будут ли его коллекции полезны науке, меня не волнует. Мне нужен рыболов, который раздобудет ему любую желанную диковинку и сохранит его щедрое расположение.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大量採集：戦旗を染め抜く青
#. de: Korallen fischen
#. fr: Grosse récolte<nbsp>: les coraux des drapeaux
#. column 1: The day of remembrance for fallen knights is close at hand, and every member of every house has lost at least one of their kin in the noble cause in the name of Halone. House Fortemps seeks to decorate the manor with a display of pride for the thousand years of service their knights have done our capital, and for the temporary memorial have requested wavekin that bear colors similar to the uniforms of the knights.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1222:0:0"
msgid "Bearing of the Blue"
msgstr "Синий цвет победы"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>皇都防衛戦の折に消失した、神殿騎士団の戦旗を仕立て直したい。そのためには、旗を青く染め抜く必要がある。鮮やかな色合いを出すために、青空珊瑚で顔料を作りたいので、大量に調達してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Im Verteidigungskampf um die Stadt wurden viele Kriegsflaggen der Tempelritter zerstört. Um neue anzufertigen, muss passender Stoff eingefärbt werden. Für die meisten Farben nutzt man Extrakte aus Kräutern und Blumen, doch einen ganz bestimmten Blauton erhält man nur aus der Blauen Wolkenkoralle. Ein Fischer, der Wolkenkorallen besorgt, soll gebührlich belohnt werden.
#. fr: Nous désirons remplacer plusieurs drapeaux des templiers qui ont été détruits lors d'une récente attaque des Dravaniens contre notre sainte Cité. Pour cela, nous avons besoin de coraux céruléens afin de fabriquer de la teinture bleue.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Bearing of the Blue
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1222:0:1"
msgid "The day of remembrance for fallen knights is close at hand, and every member of every house has lost at least one of their kin in the noble cause in the name of Halone. House Fortemps seeks to decorate the manor with a display of pride for the thousand years of service their knights have done our capital, and for the temporary memorial have requested wavekin that bear colors similar to the uniforms of the knights.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Не за горами день памяти павших рыцарей. В каждой знатной семье хотя бы кто-то погиб во имя Халонэ и благородного дела. Дом Форельтан хочет украсить поместье в честь тысячи лет службы рыцарей столице. Для временного мемориала им нужны водные создания, окраской напоминающие форму рыцарей.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：マフワイの薬効調査
#. de: Großfreibrief: Fisch in Medizin?
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: un remède de mahu waï
#. column 1: Our knights take great care in their footing when exploring the uneven terrain in the Sea of Clouds. But as they say, “the heavier the armor, the harder the fall,” and there have been too many accidents leading to broken necks and backs. Though we cannot prevent such unfortunate occurrences, we may have found a way to treat the resulting injuries. I hear that the Vanu Vanu in the area have been known to use the appendages of the mahu wai wavekin to treat paralysis. I would ask you to bring several specimens with particularly plump fins to test the rumor.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1223:0:0"
msgid "Send a Feeling to My Spine (L)"
msgstr "Пошлите весть моей спине (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>アバラシア雲海の薔薇騎兵団から、興味深い情報が寄せられた。当地に棲まうバヌバヌ族が、マフワイという雲海生物を、傷薬の材料として用いているというのだ。その効能を確認したいので、サンプルを採取してきてくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Ritter der Rosenkavalleristen wollen im Abalathischen Wolkenmeer beobachtet haben, wie die Vanu Vanu so genannte Mahu Wai in einer Medizin zur Wundbehandlung verwenden. Um dieser Sache genauer auf den Grund zu gehen, sucht das Hospital der Tempelritter nun einen Fischer, der ein paar Mahu Wai zur Unter<shy>such<shy>ung fangen kann.
#. fr: Les chevaliers de la Rose nous ont informés que les Vanu Vanu utilisent un mollusque appelé mahu waï comme ingrédient pour leurs remèdes. Nous aimerions en obtenir quelques spécimens pour en vérifier les propriétés.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Send a Feeling to My Spine (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
