#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1230:0:1"
msgid "With the opening of the Churning Mists, more curious fishermen have stumbled upon the terrain unprepared for what lies above. Therefore, the predatory brown bolo have acquired a taste and grown fat on eyes, noses, and lips, leaving the area littered with faceless corpses. Make for the Mists and cull the population of the vile fiends before they grow larger and become a pest even knights would have to contend with.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "С тех пор как открыли путь в Бушующие туманы, туда зачастили любопытные рыбаки, не подозревая, что их ждёт. Хищные бурые болы распробовали глаза, носы и губы и так разжирели, что вся округа усеяна обезображенными трупами. Отправляйтесь в туманы и проредите этих мерзких тварей, пока они не выросли и не стали угрозой даже для рыцарей.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模大量採集：義勇兵に振る舞う料理
#. de: Großfreibrief: Frische Fische
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: du pipira pira pour les volontaires
#. column 1: While a banquet provided by the Temple Knights was meant to be only for those already enlisted in the volunteer militia, it appears that the invitation list has increased threefold upon insistence that families be allowed to the event as well. Everyone enjoys a free meal, I suppose, yet it also means the main dish of pipira pira will need to be tripled in order to feed all the guests.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1231:0:0"
msgid "Plus One or Two or Three (L)"
msgstr "Ещё один, два или три (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>皇都の防衛体制の見直しに関連し、広く市民から義勇兵を募り、皇都防衛隊を結成することになった。厳しい訓練で、疲弊してきた義勇兵たちを労うため、力のつく料理を振る舞いたい。活きの良い魚を採ってきてくれ。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Zur Stärkung der Verteidigung der Stadt gegen die Drachen stellt die Kongregation der Tempelritter einen Trupp aus Freischärlern zusammen. Das Training verlangt den Kämpfern viel ab. Die Tempelritter wollen den Freischärlern zum Dank für ihren Einsatz ein kleines Festessen bereiten und suchen einen Fischer, der hierfür frischen Fisch liefern kann.
#. fr: Nous avons décidé de former des unités de volontaires composées de citoyens afin de renforcer les défenses de la sainte Cité, et pour leur permettre de faire le plein d'énergie après de durs en<shy>traî<shy>ne<shy>ments, nous comptons leur servir des plats à base de pipira pira.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Plus One or Two or Three (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1231:0:1"
msgid "While a banquet provided by the Temple Knights was meant to be only for those already enlisted in the volunteer militia, it appears that the invitation list has increased threefold upon insistence that families be allowed to the event as well. Everyone enjoys a free meal, I suppose, yet it also means the main dish of pipira pira will need to be tripled in order to feed all the guests.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Пир, устроенный рыцарями Храмовников, предназначался только для ополченцев, но семьи настояли на приглашении и список гостей вырос втрое. Все любят бесплатную еду, что уж там. Вот только теперь главного блюда — пипиры-пиры — потребуется втрое больше, чтобы накормить всех гостей.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：奇っ怪なブレードガンナー
#. de: Luftdruckwaffen
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: d'étranges poissons-arbalétriers
#. column 1: The fountfish can spew a jet of water nearly four yalms, and with such force that it can breach the skin and cause injury. We, however, utilize it for a much more useful purpose: the quelling of flames brought on by the Horde. The Temple Knights seek to create spawning pools within the capital walls and request fish that could be used as the first wave of breeding stock.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1232:0:0"
msgid "Spew Forth and Spawn"
msgstr "Изрыгать и размножаться"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>アジス・ラーには、奇っ怪な魚が棲息していると聞く。なかでも、激しい水流を放つという魚、ブレードガンナーに関しては、新たな兵器開発に繋がるのではないかと考えている。サンプルとなる個体を納品してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In Azys Lla soll es einen mysteriösen Quellenfisch geben, der eine hohe Wasserfontäne erzeugen kann, ohne dafür allzu viel Kraft aufwenden zu müssen. Diese Technik ist für den Bau neuer Waffen von überaus großem Interesse. Daher soll sie eingehend erforscht werden. Die Kongregation sucht nun einen Fischer, der zu diesem Zweck ein paar Quellenfische fängt.
#. fr: De bien étranges créatures vivraient sur le continent flottant d'Azys Lla, d'après les rumeurs. Nous avons notamment entendu parler d'un certain “poisson-arbalétrier”, qui serait capable de projeter de l'eau avec beaucoup de force. Quelques spécimens de cette espèce pourraient nous servir à développer de nouvelles armes.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Spew Forth and Spawn
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1232:0:1"
msgid "The fountfish can spew a jet of water nearly four yalms, and with such force that it can breach the skin and cause injury. We, however, utilize it for a much more useful purpose: the quelling of flames brought on by the Horde. The Temple Knights seek to create spawning pools within the capital walls and request fish that could be used as the first wave of breeding stock.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Рыба-фонтан может выпустить струю воды почти на четыре ярда — да такую сильную, что пробьёт кожу и ранит. Мы же нашли ей куда более полезное применение: тушить пожары, устроенные Ордой. Рыцари Храмовников хотят развести эту рыбу в водоёмах внутри городских стен и просят доставить первых особей для размножения.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 指定採集：風邪薬の材料
#. de: Hummer gegen den Kummer
#. fr: Collecte<nbsp>: du homard contre la grippe
#. column 1: While fish can be used as sustenance to the sick, few know that the shell of the yalm lobster can be ground into a medicinal poultice, breaking apart gummy humours in the lungs. As it just so happens, a foul cough has been spreading through House Valentione, from what I can only imagine is an excess of affection between lovers—and I have need of shells to see the house cured of ailment.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1233:0:0"
msgid "They Call It the Kissing Disease"
msgstr "Болезнь поцелуев"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>近年、皇都では悪性の熱風邪が流行りつつある。その特効薬を製造するために必要となる材料集めに、腕利きの漁師の腕を貸してもらいたい。調達してほしいのは、ヤルムロブスター。ぜひとも大振りのものを頼む。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In Ishgard geht derzeit eine schlimme Grippewelle um. Eine Medizin zur Behandlung braucht einen Bestandteil, den man nur in Yalmhummern finden kann. Ein fähiger Fischer wird gebeten, eine Ladung dieser Tiere zu besorgen und dem Hospital zur Verfügung zu stellen.
#. fr: Depuis quelque temps, les habitants de la sainte Cité sont en proie à une violente épidémie de grippe. Nous aimerions préparer un remède, mais pour cela, nous avons besoin d'un grand nombre de homards-yalm.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: They Call It the Kissing Disease
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1233:0:1"
msgid "While fish can be used as sustenance to the sick, few know that the shell of the yalm lobster can be ground into a medicinal poultice, breaking apart gummy humours in the lungs. As it just so happens, a foul cough has been spreading through House Valentione, from what I can only imagine is an excess of affection between lovers—and I have need of shells to see the house cured of ailment.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Рыба может прокормить больных, но мало кто знает, что панцирь ярдового лобстера можно растереть и сделать из него целебную мазь. Она разжижает вязкую мокроту в лёгких. Как раз в доме Валентионе разошёлся сильный кашель. Похоже, влюблённые там слишком увлеклись нежностями. Мне нужны панцири, чтобы вылечить всех домочадцев.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大量採集：異端審問官の仕事道具
#. de: Kreativer Fischgebrauch
#. fr: Grosse récolte<nbsp>: interrogatoire au poisson
#. column 1: If rumors are to be believed, there are fish in Azys Lla known as bullwhips who jump and thrash when but a mere drop of dragon blood─sweet as nectar to their palate─falls in their vicinity. I shiver with delight when I hear this, for it means a quicker way to discern an accused heretic. Could I trouble you to bring me some fresh specimens to test the theory? Do not take pains to feed them. We have plenty of food available.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1234:0:0"
msgid "Warmer than Wine"
msgstr "Теплее вина"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>アジス・ラーにて確認されたという魚、ブラックウィップを調達してもらいたい。聞くところによれば、実に獰猛なうえに、おぞましい姿をしているとか。それがあれば、何かと「仕事」が捗りそうなので、大量に調達してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Die Inquisition hat von einer Fischart in Azys Lla gehört, die sich durch ihr besonderes Aussehen vorzüglich zum Ausführen ihrer täglichen ... Arbeit eignen soll. Ein Fischer, der eine große Menge dieser so genannten Peitschenfische besorgen kann, soll es nicht bereuen.
#. fr: Un poisson d'Azys Lla connu sous le nom de “gobie-fouet” nous intéresse tout par<shy>ti<shy>cu<shy>liè<shy>rement. D'une nature violente et d'apparence repoussante, cette créature pourrait bien faciliter le travail de nos inquisiteurs. Il nous en faut à tout prix quelques spécimens<nbsp>!<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Warmer than Wine
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1234:0:1"
msgid "If rumors are to be believed, there are fish in Azys Lla known as bullwhips who jump and thrash when but a mere drop of dragon blood─sweet as nectar to their palate─falls in their vicinity. I shiver with delight when I hear this, for it means a quicker way to discern an accused heretic. Could I trouble you to bring me some fresh specimens to test the theory? Do not take pains to feed them. We have plenty of food available.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Если верить слухам, в Азис Лла водятся рыбы-хлысты. Стоит поблизости упасть хотя бы капле драконьей крови — сладкой, словно нектар, — и они начинают прыгать и биться. От этих слов меня пробирает приятная дрожь: значит, обвинённых в ереси можно будет распознавать быстрее. Принесите свежих рыб, чтобы проверить теорию. Не утруждайтесь их кормить, еды у нас и так полно.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：奇っ怪なブレードガンナー
#. de: Großfreibrief: Luftdruckwaffen
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: d'étranges poissons-arbalétriers
#. column 1: Upon witnessing the wavekin's ability to cast water through the air, a high-ranking cardinal ordered pools of the recently discovered fountfish placed atop every home in the Pillars, declaring that the fish would save Ishgard from the flames of the Horde. Coin to fund this grand undertaking was diverted from a new Brume orphanage, but the Vault still requires someone to actually catch and deliver barrels of the wavekin back to the capital.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1235:0:0"
msgid "Unleash the Hydro Cannons (L)"
msgstr "Высвободить водяные пушки (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>アジス・ラーには、奇っ怪な魚が棲息していると聞く。なかでも、激しい水流を放つという魚、ブレードガンナーに関しては、新たな兵器開発に繋がるのではないかと考えている。サンプルとなる個体を納品してもらいたい。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In Azys Lla soll es einen mysteriösen Quellenfisch geben, der eine hohe Wasserfontäne erzeugen kann, ohne dafür allzu viel Kraft aufwenden zu müssen. Diese Technik ist für den Bau neuer Waffen von überaus großem Interesse. Daher soll sie eingehend erforscht werden. Die Kongregation sucht nun einen Fischer, der zu diesem Zweck ein paar Quellenfische fängt.
#. fr: De bien étranges créatures vivraient sur le continent flottant d'Azys Lla, d'après les rumeurs. Nous avons notamment entendu parler d'un certain “poisson-arbalétrier”, qui serait capable de projeter de l'eau avec beaucoup de force. Quelques spécimens de cette espèce pourraient nous servir à développer de nouvelles armes.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Unleash the Hydro Cannons (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Leve:1235:0:1"
msgid "Upon witnessing the wavekin's ability to cast water through the air, a high-ranking cardinal ordered pools of the recently discovered fountfish placed atop every home in the Pillars, declaring that the fish would save Ishgard from the flames of the Horde. Coin to fund this grand undertaking was diverted from a new Brume orphanage, but the Vault still requires someone to actually catch and deliver barrels of the wavekin back to the capital.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
msgstr "Увидев, как водные создания метают струи воды, высокопоставленный кардинал приказал поставить бассейны с недавно открытой рыбой-фонтаном на крышах всех домов в Столпах. Он заявил, что рыбы спасут Ишгард от огня Орды. Деньги на этот грандиозный замысел отняли у нового приюта в Туманной низине, но Сокровищнице всё ещё нужны те, кто наловит и доставит в столицу целые бочки этих созданий.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Требуется: рыболовная снасть</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"

#. ja: 大規模指定採集：風邪薬の材料
#. de: Großfreibrief: Hummer gegen den Kummer
#. fr: Grand mandat<nbsp>: du homard contre la grippe
#. column 1: An outbreak of boils in the Pillars has caused the demand for yalm lobster poultices to skyrocket. The price of one has increased to that of three, and 'twould seem much more logical to simply forsake the middleman and commission an angler myself to procure the shells needed.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Requires: Fishing Tackle</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
msgctxt "Leve:1236:0:0"
msgid "Angling for Ailments (L)"
msgstr "Удить от недугов (Б)"

#. ja: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>採集手段：釣り</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>近年、皇都では悪性の熱風邪が流行りつつある。その特効薬を製造するために必要となる材料集めに、腕利きの漁師の腕を貸してもらいたい。調達してほしいのは、ヤルムロブスター。ぜひとも大振りのものを頼む。
#. de: <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sammelmethode: Angeln</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>In Ishgard geht derzeit eine schlimme Grippewelle um. Eine Medizin zur Behandlung braucht einen Bestandteil, den man nur in Yalmhummern finden kann. Ein fähiger Fischer wird gebeten, eine Ladung dieser Tiere zu besorgen und dem Hospital zur Verfügung zu stellen.
#. fr: Depuis quelque temps, les habitants de la sainte Cité sont en proie à une violente épidémie de grippe. Nous aimerions préparer un remède, mais pour cela, nous avons besoin d'un grand nombre de homards-yalm.<br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Mode de pêche<nbsp>: à la ligne</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
#. column 0: Angling for Ailments (L)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
